<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: transparent">The Group&rsquo;s
electricity costs for 2024 were approximately &pound;25,000 (2023: &pound;30,000). The kWh usage in the year was 81,933 (2023: 87,780).
The Group has no immediate plans to improve energy efficiency.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: transparent">&nbsp;</P>

