<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The reasons for the difference between the actual tax credit for the
year and the standard rate of corporation tax in the United Kingdom applied to losses for the year are as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

